&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/?utm_source=newswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=press-release&amp;amp;utm_campaign=PlatformforAISuccess&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dataiku&lt;/a&gt; is the Platform for AI Success, the enterprise orchestration layer for building, deploying, and governing AI. In a single environment, teams design and operate analytics, machine learning, and AI agents with the transparency, collaboration, and control enterprises require. Sitting above data platforms, cloud infrastructure, and AI services, Dataiku connects the full enterprise AI stack — empowering organizations to run AI across multi-vendor environments with centralized governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The world’s leading companies rely on Dataiku to operationalize AI and run it as a true business performance engine delivering measurable value. For more, visit the Dataiku &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.dataiku.com/?_gl=1*17edvf4*_ga*MjA1Mjk5NzY4OC4xNjY3MjMyMDUz*_ga_B3YXRYMY48*MTY2OTA1MDY5NS4xMi4xLjE2NjkwNTA2OTguNTcuMC4w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an AI Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Science Solutions Consultant to join Dataiku’s Business Solutions department with a strong focus on supporting US business expansion. The role reports to the Health &amp;amp; Life Science Sr. Director. Your mission will be undertaken in close partnership with Dataiku’s broader Business Solutions team, including the Life Sciences Solution AI Engineers, as well as with Dataiku’s core teams: Sales, Customer, Partnership, Product and R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will support three essential missions:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(1) Feed our strategic vision towards Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences&lt;/strong&gt; and how to further accelerate&amp;nbsp; our growth in this industry. This will involve developing a deep understanding of Dataiku’s footprint, strong convictions as to analytics, ML and agent value for priority domains, current and target positioning in the ecosystem, and supporting the right plans to meet our ambitions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(2) Be a&amp;nbsp; Dataiku SME on Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences&lt;/strong&gt;, and act as a gap bridger between precise industry needs, AI and Dataiku as a product. You will directly support clients and prospects as a trusted expert and support the development of the right assets and engagement support to boost GTM effectiveness in Life Sciences. In practice, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support sales and customer activities on Life Sciences: help customer dynamics understanding, act as a key spokesperson for prospects and customers, supporting executive engagement building.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate the specific value proposal of Dataiku for Life Sciences, and enable internal client facing teams in its articulating.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the capitalization of internal knowledge and client experiences on Life Sciences (adoption stories, use-cases, …) and contribute to development of relevant material.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost Dataiku’s visibility on Life Sciences as an industry, as well as engage in the&amp;nbsp; execution of an impactful thought-leadership strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive high impact Customer Engagements with key decision makers in Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(3) Contribute to&amp;nbsp; the identification, scoping, and successful roll out of&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/solutions/catalog/&quot;&gt;Dataiku Solutions&lt;/a&gt; aligned to Healthcare and Life Sciences needs, with the goal of maximizing Dataiku’s value delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel the Solutions development pipeline through business experience, client workshops, market watch, partnership discussions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Solutions taskforce (Product, R&amp;amp;D, UX, Partnerships, Data Scientists …), jointly with the HLS Sr. Director,&amp;nbsp; in ensuring prompt development of&amp;nbsp; relevant projects, which could include: off-the-shelf solution design, customer-specific solutions, feature and application development, …&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support general push on AI Solutions offering by contributing to&amp;nbsp; relevant documents, to enablement of teams, to customer interactions, to GTM material, …&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years experience in Healthcare and/or in Life Sciences, with a confirmed appetite for data, analytics and AI impact in the sector. You have worked within Healthcare and/or Life Science organizations, preferably in the US, and have owned the successful delivery of AI projects or built technology towards this objective.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a preciseunderstanding of Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences value chain, including complex processes and regulations involved in health provider organizations like large hospital networks or specialized care centers and health payers, sophisticated frameworks embedded in pharma companies from R&amp;amp;D and Clinical Operations teams to sales force effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the capacity to adjust your communication to experts and non experts. You are passionate about people empowerment with data and AI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Business Development mindset: you understand the ins and outs of software acquisition, and are able to support plans towards business development ambitions. Experience in acquiring software in a Healthcare or Life Sciences organization and managing vendor relationship will be a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid solution management experience, with the capacity to outline user journeys, scope use-case, and support development end-to-end including organizing customer co-builds, testing and reviews. You will be involved in conducting detailed feature/solution scoping and validation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Precise and effective in describing the continuum of ways in which data, analytics and AI can add value, from automation, pipelines and dashboards to machine learning and Generative AI. You have good understanding of agents and are able to project their potential as well as&amp;nbsp; evaluate their ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record working with diverse teams, and successfully engaging them on complex or specialized topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills (both written and oral), able to clearly articulate and present complex situations and concepts to varied audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in AMERICAS and able to travel both within that region (20% of the time) and occasionally&amp;nbsp; to other continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JR1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are you waiting for!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Dataiku, you&#39;ll be part of a journey to shape the ever-evolving world of AI. We&#39;re not just building a product; we&#39;re crafting the future of AI. If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact in a company that values innovation, collaboration, and your personal growth, we can&#39;t wait to welcome you to Dataiku! And if you’d like to learn even more about working here, you can visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot;&gt;Dataiku LinkedIn page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our practices are rooted in the idea that everyone should be treated with dignity, decency and fairness. Dataiku also believes that a diverse identity is a source of strength and allows us to optimize across the many dimensions that are needed for our success. Therefore, we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp;All employment practices are based on business needs, without regard to race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, veteran status or any other aspect which makes an individual unique or protected by laws and regulations in the locations where we operate. This applies to all policies and procedures related to recruitment and hiring, compensation, benefits, performance, promotion and termination and all other conditions and terms of employment. If you need assistance or an accommodation, please contact us at: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;http://reasonable-accommodations@dataiku.com/&quot;&gt;reasonable-accommodations@dataiku.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself from fraudulent recruitment activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dataiku will never ask you for payment of any type during the interview or hiring process. Other than our video-conference application, Zoom, we will also never ask you to make purchases or download third-party applications during the process. If you experience something out of the ordinary or suspect fraudulent activity, please review our page on identifying and reporting fraudulent activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/legal/dataiku-recruitment-scams/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/?utm_source=newswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=press-release&amp;amp;utm_campaign=PlatformforAISuccess&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dataiku&lt;/a&gt; is the Platform for AI Success, the enterprise orchestration layer for building, deploying, and governing AI. In a single environment, teams design and operate analytics, machine learning, and AI agents with the transparency, collaboration, and control enterprises require. Sitting above data platforms, cloud infrastructure, and AI services, Dataiku connects the full enterprise AI stack — empowering organizations to run AI across multi-vendor environments with centralized governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The world’s leading companies rely on Dataiku to operationalize AI and run it as a true business performance engine delivering measurable value. For more, visit the Dataiku &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.dataiku.com/?_gl=1*17edvf4*_ga*MjA1Mjk5NzY4OC4xNjY3MjMyMDUz*_ga_B3YXRYMY48*MTY2OTA1MDY5NS4xMi4xLjE2NjkwNTA2OTguNTcuMC4w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Business Development Representative to join our growing Central European Team. As a Business Development Representative DACH. You will be responsible for driving Dataiku&#39;s business development activities. You must be able to understand the sales development process and technology stack, and ensure their adoption. We are looking for a results-driven, hands-on self-starter, motivated to constantly improve and optimise the process to drive performance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll Make An Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a large volume of daily inbound and outbound leads - connecting via phone, email and LinkedIn and qualifying them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with our Sales and Marketing executives to design, research and execute outbound vertical and/or geographical markets campaigns to grow the sales pipeline in a dedicated territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our Sales Executives to prospect and close large enterprise deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate and nurture early-phase prospects for potential future opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate knowledge of Dataiku DSS and its value proposition and an understanding of the Big Data ecosystem to converse with data and business leaders from SMB to high-growth companies, to large multinationals in industries such as e-commerce, retail, banking, insurance, utilities, and transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse and report on your weekly activities to identify potential optimisations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need To Be Successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Level German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and excellent verbal and written communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have relevant experience and proven success in sales or business development in the software / tech industry or in a startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to demonstrate organisational and project management skills with the ability to handle pressure and a high volume of tasks in a result-oriented environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical and understand the need to track everything you do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in innovative issues such as Data Science and Predictive Analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-CM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are you waiting for!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Dataiku, you&#39;ll be part of a journey to shape the ever-evolving world of AI. We&#39;re not just building a product; we&#39;re crafting the future of AI. If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact in a company that values innovation, collaboration, and your personal growth, we can&#39;t wait to welcome you to Dataiku! And if you’d like to learn even more about working here, you can visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot;&gt;Dataiku LinkedIn page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our practices are rooted in the idea that everyone should be treated with dignity, decency and fairness. Dataiku also believes that a diverse identity is a source of strength and allows us to optimize across the many dimensions that are needed for our success. Therefore, we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp;All employment practices are based on business needs, without regard to race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, veteran status or any other aspect which makes an individual unique or protected by laws and regulations in the locations where we operate. This applies to all policies and procedures related to recruitment and hiring, compensation, benefits, performance, promotion and termination and all other conditions and terms of employment. If you need assistance or an accommodation, please contact us at: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;http://reasonable-accommodations@dataiku.com/&quot;&gt;reasonable-accommodations@dataiku.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself from fraudulent recruitment activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dataiku will never ask you for payment of any type during the interview or hiring process. Other than our video-conference application, Zoom, we will also never ask you to make purchases or download third-party applications during the process. If you experience something out of the ordinary or suspect fraudulent activity, please review our page on identifying and reporting fraudulent activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/legal/dataiku-recruitment-scams/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/?utm_source=newswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=press-release&amp;amp;utm_campaign=PlatformforAISuccess&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dataiku&lt;/a&gt; is the Platform for AI Success, the enterprise orchestration layer for building, deploying, and governing AI. In a single environment, teams design and operate analytics, machine learning, and AI agents with the transparency, collaboration, and control enterprises require. Sitting above data platforms, cloud infrastructure, and AI services, Dataiku connects the full enterprise AI stack — empowering organizations to run AI across multi-vendor environments with centralized governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The world’s leading companies rely on Dataiku to operationalize AI and run it as a true business performance engine delivering measurable value. For more, visit the Dataiku &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.dataiku.com/?_gl=1*17edvf4*_ga*MjA1Mjk5NzY4OC4xNjY3MjMyMDUz*_ga_B3YXRYMY48*MTY2OTA1MDY5NS4xMi4xLjE2NjkwNTA2OTguNTcuMC4w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dataiku is seeking a Customer Marketing Manager to help bring our customer success stories to life and amplify the voice of our Global 2000 customers across the market. Reporting to the Senior Manager of Customer Marketing, this role will be responsible for developing compelling customer content, managing advocacy initiatives, and activating customer proof points across marketing, sales, analyst relations, and corporate communications programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is focused on execution, content development, and program support within an established customer marketing strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with customers and cross-functional teams to develop customer stories and marketing content for use across campaigns, sales, and communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires equal parts content creator, customer advocate, and marketing program operator—someone who can not only develop great stories but also ensure those stories are activated across the business to drive measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Storytelling &amp;amp; Content Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop customer marketing content, including written case studies, executive narratives, testimonials, blog posts, and digital assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with customers and internal stakeholders to identify, capture, develop, and secure approval of compelling stories that demonstrate measurable business outcomes and business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct customer interviews and translate complex technical and business achievements into engaging, audience-focused narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all customer-facing content meets Dataiku&#39;s standards for quality, accuracy, brand consistency, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a pipeline of customer stories aligned to defined content needs and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Advocacy &amp;amp; Reference Activation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the growth and activation of Dataiku&#39;s customer advocacy ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and coordinate customer advocates in partnership with Customer Success, Account Teams, and Executive Sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate customer participation in events, webinars, analyst engagements, media opportunities, product launches, and peer-to-peer activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support a smooth and positive experience for customer advocates throughout their engagement with Dataiku.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track advocacy activity and identify opportunities to deepen engagement over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Proof Activation &amp;amp; Business Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing, Demand Generation, Field Marketing, Sales, PR, Analyst Relations, andContent teams to deploy customer stories across campaigns, sales enablement, and communications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to repurpose and adapt customer content for use across multiple audiences and stages of the customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Program Management &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key liaison across Customer Success, Sales, Product Marketing, Brand, Corporate Communications, Field Marketing, and other stakeholders to align customer marketing activities with business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end execution of customer marketing initiatives, including project planning, stakeholder communications, approvals, legal reviews, customer permissions, and publication workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the identification and prioritization of customer stories, advocates, and reference opportunities based on strategic business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records of customer references, content assets, advocacy activities, and participation history within Champion and related systems, ensuring materials remain organized, discoverable, and accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support program reporting, measurement, and performance tracking to help optimize customer marketing and advocacy efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Growth &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on customer marketing best practices, advocacy trends, content formats, and emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and leverage AI-powered tools and workflows to improve content development, customer research, program management, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas to improve customer storytelling and content formats that strengthen Dataiku&#39;s market presence and customer community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Required:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in customer marketing, content marketing, advocacy, communications, public relations, or related B2B marketing roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating customer-facing content such as case studies, customer stories, videos, executive content, blogs, or thought leadership assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interviewing, writing, editing, and storytelling skills with the ability to translate complex business and technical concepts into compelling narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing cross-functional projects involving multiple stakeholders and competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build trusted relationships with customers, executives, sales teams, and internal partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational, communication, and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to incorporate AI-powered tools into day-to-day work, including content creation, research, marketing tools, or project management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in SaaS, enterprise software, AI, analytics, data, or technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with customer advocacy, reference management, or community platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dataiku consistently produces high-quality customer stories that showcase measurable business outcomes and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer advocates actively participate in strategic marketing, sales, analyst, and event initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer proof points are effectively activated across campaigns, sales programs, events, analyst relations, and communications initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer stories contribute meaningfully to awareness, engagement, pipeline creation, sales acceleration, and market credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal teams can easily discover, access, and activate customer references and content assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocacy participation and customer storytelling efforts continue to scale while maintaining a world-class customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The customer marketing function is recognized as a strategic driver of trust, credibility, customer engagement, and business growth across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The final compensation package for this role will be determined during the interview process and is based on a variety of factors, including, but not limited to, geographic location, internal equity, education, skill set, experience and training. Eligible roles may also be entitled to receive commission or other variable compensation through Dataiku&#39;s incentive compensation program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Dataiku also offers comprehensive benefits, including stock options, medical, dental, and vision plans, flexible spending accounts, pre-tax commuter benefits, a 401k company match, paid vacations and sick leave, paid parental leave, employer paid disability coverage, and additional health and wellbeing perks and benefits. Dataiku reserves the right to amend or modify employee perks and benefits at any time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US only national base pay ranges&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are you waiting for!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Dataiku, you&#39;ll be part of a journey to shape the ever-evolving world of AI. We&#39;re not just building a product; we&#39;re crafting the future of AI. If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact in a company that values innovation, collaboration, and your personal growth, we can&#39;t wait to welcome you to Dataiku! And if you’d like to learn even more about working here, you can visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot;&gt;Dataiku LinkedIn page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
