&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Account plans and a pipeline generation plan in place across your territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Early leading indicators on track: 4–5 meetings booked and 3–4 completed in your first quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
