&lt;li&gt;Experience in the data science, analytics, or big data markets preferred but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data storage and computing infrastructure for data of all sizes (SQL, NoSQL, Kubernetes, Spark, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
